PROJECT: Ethereum

## Token Information

Official Token Name: Ether (HIGH) [Ethereum.org, https://ethereum.org/en/eth/]
Symbol: ETH (HIGH) [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/ethereum]
Token Standard: Native asset (bukan ERC-20; ETH adalah aset protokol Layer 1) (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - ETH, https://ethereum.org/en/eth/; Etherscan Token Tracker (tidak ada kontrak untuk ETH native), https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee]
Blockchain: Ethereum Mainnet (Layer 1) (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - Networks, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/networks/]
Contract Address: Native asset (tidak ada kontrak token pada mainnet; placeholder 0xEeeeeEeeeEeEeeEeEeEeeEEEeeeeEeeeeeeeEEeE digunakan di beberapa konteks untuk mewakili native ETH) (HIGH) [Etherscan, https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee; 1inch Token Reference, https://tokens.1inch.io/]
Decimals: 18 (HIGH) [Ethereum Yellow Paper, https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf; Ethereum.org - ETH, https://ethereum.org/en/eth/]
Status: Live (HIGH) [Ethereum.org, https://ethereum.org/en/eth/]
