## Supply

Maximum Supply: Tidak ada (unbounded / tidak fixed) (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - ETH Supply, https://ethereum.org/en/eth/; Vitalik Buterin Blog - Supply, https://vitalik.eth.limo/general/2017/12/19/eth_supply.html]
Total Supply: ~120.200.000 ETH (perkiraan Oktober 2024, berubah real-time) (MEDIUM) [Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/; Etherscan Total Supply, https://etherscan.io/stat/ethsupply]
Circulating Supply: ~120.200.000 ETH (sama dengan total supply karena tidak ada token terkunci protokol; staked ETH tetap liquid via LST) (MEDIUM) [Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/; Beaconcha.in Staked ETH, https://beaconcha.in/]
Initial Supply: 72.000.000 ETH (genesis block: 60.000.000 ETH crowdsale + 12.000.000 ETH Foundation/early contributors) (HIGH) [Ethereum Blog - Frontier, https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Supply Type: Dynamic (inflationary/deflationary bergantung net issuance vs base fee burn) (HIGH) [EIP-1559, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559; Consensus Specs - Issuance, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md; Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/]
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/eth/ ; https://ultrasound.money/ ; https://etherscan.io/stat/ethsupply ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md

