Community (Crowdsale Participants): 60.000.000 ETH (83,3% initial supply) (HIGH) [Ethereum Blog - Ether Sale, https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Foundation (Ethereum Foundation): Bagian dari 12.000.000 ETH (persentase pasti tidak dipublikasikan per entitas) (MEDIUM) [Ethereum Blog - Frontier, https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Team / Early Contributors: Bagian dari 12.000.000 ETH (persentase pasti tidak dipublikasikan per individu/entitas) (MEDIUM) [Ethereum Blog - Frontier, https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Investors: Tidak ada investor tradisional (VC/private sale) sebelum crowdsale; crowdsale terbuka ke publik (HIGH) [Ethereum Blog - Ether Sale, https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Treasury (Ethereum Foundation Treasury): Tidak diungkap jumlah ETH spesifik; analyst memperkirakan >200k ETH pada alamat terkait EF (estimasi eksternal) (LOW) [Ethereum Foundation Annual Report 2023, https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/; Nansen/Arkham analyst estimates, tidak ada URL resmi tunggal]
Ecosystem / Grants: Didanai dari Foundation treasury (bagian dari 12M ETH awal + pengelolaan aset berkelanjutan) (MEDIUM) [EF Grants, https://esp.ethereum.foundation/; EF Annual Report 2023, https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/]
Advisors: Tidak ada alokasi advisor terpisah terdokumentasi publik (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile; Ethereum Blog - Frontier, https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming]
Other (Pre-Merge PoW Mining Rewards): ~58.000.000 ETH di-mine antara 2015-2022 (estimasi kumulatif block rewards + uncle rewards) (MEDIUM) [Etherscan Historical Supply, https://etherscan.io/stat/ethsupply; Consensus Specs - PoW Issuance (historical), https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md]
