## Vesting Schedule

Category: Crowdsale Participants
Cliff: Tidak ada (token langsung unlocked pada genesis block)
Vesting: Tidak ada (fully unlocked at TGE/genesis)
Unlock Frequency: N/A
Current Status: Fully unlocked sejak 2015-07-30
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming

Category: Foundation / Early Contributors (12M ETH)
Cliff: Tidak diketahui secara detail per penerima; tidak ada jadwal vesting on-chain yang dipublikasikan resmi
Vesting: Tidak diketahui secara detail; didistribusikan secara internal EF sejak genesis
Unlock Frequency: N/A
Current Status: Fully unlocked (diasumsikan; tidak ada kontrak vesting on-chain untuk genesis allocation)
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming ; https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile

Category: PoW Mining Rewards (Historical 2015-2022)
Cliff: Tidak ada
Vesting: Continuous per block (5 ETH → 3 ETH → 2 ETH per block sesuai hard fork)
Unlock Frequency: Per block (~13 detik)
Current Status: Berhenti pada The Merge (2022-09-15)
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2017/10/12/byzantium-hard-fork ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2019/02/22/ethereum-constantinople-hard-fork ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/09/15/the-merge-is-done

Category: PoS Validator Rewards (Post-Merge)
Cliff: Tidak ada
Vesting: Continuous per epoch (attestation/reward) + withdrawal credentials 0x01 untuk partial/full withdrawal (Shanghai/Capella 2023-04-12)
Unlock Frequency: Per epoch (~6,4 menit) untuk rewards; withdrawal queue untuk principal
Current Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/03/28/shanghai-announcement ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4895

