## Utility

Utility: Gas / Transaction Fees
Deskripsi: ETH digunakan untuk membayar base fee (dibakar) dan priority fee (ke validator) untuk setiap transaksi dan komputasi EVM
Status: Live
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/gas/ ; https://ethereum.org/en/eth/

Utility: Staking / Validator Security
Deskripsi: Minimum 32 ETH untuk menjalankan validator; stake dijamin (slashing) untuk keamanan konsensus PoS (Gasper)
Status: Live (sejak Beacon Chain genesis 2020-12-01)
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/staking/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2020/11/27/eth2-genesis-confirmed

Utility: Validator Rewards / Incentive
Deskripsi: Validator menerima issuance ETH baru (beacon chain rewards) + priority tips + MEV-Boost payments untuk block proposal dan attestation
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md ; https://flashbots.net/ ; https://mevboost.pics/

Utility: Collateral / DeFi Primitive
Deskripsi: ETH digunakan sebagai collateral utama di DeFi (MakerDAO, Aave, Lido, dll.) dan untuk mint stablecoin (DAI), liquid staking tokens (stETH, rETH)
Status: Live
Sources: https://defillama.com/chain/Ethereum ; https://makerdao.com/ ; https://lido.fi/ ; https://rocketpool.net/

Utility: Liquidity / Trading Pair
Deskripsi: ETH adalah base pair utama di DEX (Uniswap, Curve, Balancer) dan CEX; deep liquidity untuk seluruh ekosistem
Status: Live
Sources: https://uniswap.org/ ; https://curve.fi/ ; https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/ethereum

Utility: Governance (Informal / Off-chain)
Deskripsi: ETH tidak digunakan untuk on-chain token voting; governance melalui EIP process (off-chain social consensus), core dev calls, dan client adoption signaling
Status: Live
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/pm ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/03/08/client-diversity

Utility: Fee Payment (L2 / Rollup)
Deskripsi: ETH digunakan untuk membayar L2 transaction fees (base fee + tip) dan untuk mendanai deposit/withdrawal ke L1; blob fees (EIP-4844) dibayar dalam ETH
Status: Live (EIP-4844 live sejak Dencun 2024-03-13)
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844 ; https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/dencun/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Utility: Unit of Account / Denomination
Deskripsi: ETH (dan sub-unit wei, gwei) digunakan sebagai unit account standar untuk gas pricing, token pricing, dan nilai ekosistem
Status: Live
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/gas/ ; https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf

Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://ethereum.org/en/staking/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md ; https://defillama.com/chain/Ethereum ; https://uniswap.org/ ; https://eips.ethereum.org/ ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844

## Governance

Governance Model: Off-chain Social Consensus (EIP Process + Core Dev Calls + Client Implementation Signaling) (HIGH) [EIPs Repository, https://eips.ethereum.org/; Ethereum Core Dev Calls, https://github.com/ethereum/pm; Ethereum.org Governance, https://ethereum.org/en/governance/]
Voting System: Tidak ada on-chain token voting; keputusan melalui rough consensus pada EIP discussions, All Core Devs calls, dan client team adoption (HIGH) [EIPs Process, https://eips.ethereum.org/; Core Dev Calls, https://github.com/ethereum/pm]
Voting Power: Tidak berlaku (bukan token-weighted voting); pengaruh berbasis reputasi teknis, client market share, dan komunitas (HIGH) [Ethereum.org Governance, https://ethereum.org/en/governance/; Vitalik Buterin - Governance, https://vitalik.eth.limo/general/2017/12/17/voting.html]
Delegation: Tidak ada delegasi voting power on-chain; validator tidak memiliki voting power protokol (hanya signaling via client version) (HIGH) [Consensus Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs; Ethereum.org Governance, https://ethereum.org/en/governance/]
Proposal System: EIP (Ethereum Improvement Proposal) process — draft → review → last call → final → client implementation → hard fork activation (HIGH) [EIP-1, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1; EIPs Repository, https://eips.ethereum.org/]
Treasury Governance: Ethereum Foundation (Stiftung) mengelola treasury secara independen; tidak ada on-chain treasury governance oleh token holder (HIGH) [Ethereum Foundation, https://ethereum.org/en/foundation/; EF Annual Report 2023, https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/]
Status: Live (ongoing process)
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/pm ; https://ethereum.org/en/governance/ ; https://vitalik.eth.limo/general/2017/12/17/voting.html ; https://ethereum.org/en/foundation/ ; https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/

## Inflation / Deflation

Inflation Mechanism: PoS Issuance (Beacon Chain rewards ke validator) — ~0,5%–0,8% per tahun netto tergantung total ETH staked (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Issuance, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md; Beaconcha.in, https://beaconcha.in/; Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/]
Emission Schedule: Continuous per epoch; base reward ~proportional 1/sqrt(total_active_validators) * effective_balance; tidak ada halving schedule tetap (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Rewards, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md#rewards-and-penalties; Ethereum.org Staking Rewards, https://ethereum.org/en/staking/]
Burn Mechanism: EIP-1559 Base Fee Burn (setiap transaksi membakar base fee) + EIP-4844 Blob Gas Burn (blob base fee dibakar) (HIGH) [EIP-1559, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559; EIP-4844, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844; Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/]
Buyback: Tidak ada (protokol tidak melakukan buyback; burn adalah mekanisme supply reduction) (HIGH) [EIP-1559, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559; Ethereum.org - Ultrasound Money, https://ethereum.org/en/ultrasound-money/]
Supply Reduction: Net deflationary ketika base fee burn > issuance (terjadi saat aktivitas tinggi); net inflationary ketika aktivitas rendah; seit Dencun (Maret 2024) blob fees menambah burn (HIGH) [Ultrasound.money, https://ultrasound.money/; EIP-1559, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559; EIP-4844, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844]
Status: Live (dynamic equilibrium)
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844 ; https://ultrasound.money/ ; https://beaconcha.in/ ; https://ethereum.org/en/ultrasound-money/

## Holder Distribution

Top Holder Concentration: Tidak ada data resmi konsolidasi; analyzer on-chain (Nansen, Arkham, Glassnode) menunjukkan top 100 alamat non-contract memegang ~30-40% supply (termasuk exchange, LST contracts, EF-related, whale) (MEDIUM) [Nansen/Arkham/Glassnode public dashboards, tidak ada URL resmi tunggal; Etherscan Token Holders, https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee#balances]
Foundation Holding: Tidak diungkap resmi; estimator eksternal (Nansen/Arkham) memperkirakan alamat terkait EF ~200k-300k ETH (LOW) [Ethereum Foundation Annual Report 2023, https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/; Nansen/Arkham estimates, tidak ada URL resmi]
Investor Holding: Tidak ada investor tradisional (VC/private sale); early contributors (founders, devs) menerima bagian dari 12M ETH genesis — jumlah per individu tidak dipublikasikan (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile; Ethereum Blog - Frontier, https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming]
Treasury Holding: Ethereum Foundation treasury (jumlah ETH tidak diungkap); tidak ada protokol treasury on-chain terpisah (MEDIUM) [Ethereum Foundation Annual Report 2023, https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/]
Community Holding: Mayoritas supply tersebar ke ribuan pemegang crowdsale, penambang PoW historis, validator PoS, pengguna DeFi, dan exchange (HIGH) [Etherscan Holders, https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee#balances; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]
Whale Concentration: Exchange cold wallets (Binance, Coinbase, Kraken, OKX, Bybit) + LST contracts (Lido stETH, Rocket Pool rETH, Coinbase cbETH) + besar whale individu mendominasi top holders; Lido stETH contract sendiri >25% total supply (MEDIUM) [Etherscan Top Holders, https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee#balances; Lido Finance, https://lido.fi/; Rated Network, https://www.rated.network/]
Sources: https://etherscan.io/token/0xeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee#balances ; https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile ; https://lido.fi/ ; https://www.rated.network/

